/// Splits text at every occurrence of sep.
/// Parameters: text, sep (must not be empty)
/// Returns: the parts in order; "a,,b" gives {"a", "", "b"}
/// Complexity: linear in text.size()
split("a,,b", ",") -> [a] [] [b]
